-- Local-only sample data (db:reset runs this; hosted projects never do).
--
-- 64 Singapore places shaped like Places API (New) results. Hand-written for dev and
-- the class demo: names and areas are real, but ratings, hours and descriptions are
-- approximate, not live Google data.
--
-- Inserting into raw_places fires the normalize trigger, so public.places fills itself.
-- Places stay untagged (enrich_status = 'pending') until you run the LLM tagging job:
--   npm run enrich -w api
on conflict (google_place_id) do nothing;
